Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Makes Windows save a small crash dump when KeyFish.exe crashes, to %LOCALAPPDATA%\CrashDumps.
; Double-click to turn it on (needs administrator rights); crash-dumps-off.reg turns it off again.
; The dump holds part of KeyFish's memory, which can include the last few words typed:
; send it only to the developer, don't post it publicly.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\Windows Error Reporting\LocalDumps\KeyFish.exe]
"DumpType"=dword:00000001
"DumpCount"=dword:00000003
